title: Return to hand
subtitle: Leave without acting; the card goes back to your hand. Opening a card and returning it cost nothing.
view-if: last_advisor_action = 0 and last_cabinet_action = 0
go-to: root
on-arrival: {!
// Viewing and closing a card is free (technical reference 4.3): undo exactly what the card
// recorded when it opened, and return it to the hand if it came from there. After an option has
// been chosen, closing is only navigation and refunds nothing.
PolishRules.closeCard(Q, this.state);
!}
